bilang isang MMA fighter

717
00:34:24.029 --> 00:34:26.331
at bilang Mad Dog.

718
00:34:28.033 --> 00:34:30.569
[Juyeong] Mas mabuting dalhin niya ang kanyang A-game.

719
00:34:30.635 --> 00:34:32.337
Hindi ako madaling lumaban.

