771
00:37:11.429 --> 00:37:12.564
[contestant] Ay, anak...

772
00:37:13.498 --> 00:37:15.767
- Sandali, bigyan mo ako.
- [Tumawa si Dex]

773
00:37:15.834 --> 00:37:17.202
Ang isang ito ay medyo matigas.

774
00:37:17.769 --> 00:37:19.437
[contestant] Maaaring nakuha na ito ng Red corner.

775
00:37:20.538 --> 00:37:22.440
