808
00:38:45.623 --> 00:38:48.560
Kaya sana ang iba sa inyo
patuloy na nagdadala ng parehong enerhiya.

809
00:38:48.626 --> 00:38:49.761
Mahusay na trabaho.

810
00:38:49.828 --> 00:38:51.262
- Salamat, ginoo!
- Pahalagahan ito!

811
00:38:52.230 --> 00:38:53.998
I think they both deserved it too.

812
00:38:54.532 --> 00:38:56.134
- Napakahusay nilang dalawa.
- [Jongkook] Oo.

813
00:38:56.768 --> 00:38:59.337
[Lee] Ang susunod kong pipiliin ay

814
00:38:59.404 --> 00:39:01.406
Singsing No. 4.

815
00:39:01.472 --> 00:39:03.208
Singsing No. 4.

816
00:39:05.210 --> 00:39:07.111
