Ang laban na gusto kong makita muna ay...

1313
01:02:06.323 --> 01:02:07.390
Singsing No. 4.

1314
01:02:07.457 --> 01:02:09.659
[bumubulalas, pumapalakpak ang mga kalahok]

1315
01:02:09.726 --> 01:02:11.628
LEE CHAEHYUN VERSUS JAEIL

1316
01:02:11.695 --> 01:02:13.463
- Tayo na!
- Go, Lee Chaehyun!

1317
01:02:13.530 --> 01:02:15.465
Gawin natin ito, Chaehyun!

1318
01:02:15.532 --> 01:02:16.933
- Saludo!
- Sige!

1319
01:02:19.069 --> 01:02:21.638
Hello, ako si Lee Chaehyun,

1320
