1389
01:05:21.284 --> 01:05:22.919
[contestant]
Wow, ang galing-galing nila doon.

1390
01:05:23.486 --> 01:05:26.189
Ang tangkad talaga ni Kuk Seungjun, I see.

1391
01:05:26.823 --> 01:05:28.558
[Sungwoon] Oh, ang magandang lalaki?

1392
01:05:30.093 --> 01:05:32.562
Kuk Seungjun?

1393
