1567
01:13:21.931 --> 01:13:23.099
Wow, kamangha-mangha.

1568
01:13:23.165 --> 01:13:24.867
Aling coconut shoulders ang mananalo?

1569
01:13:24.934 --> 01:13:26.869
- Kahon.
- Kahon!

1570
01:13:28.371 --> 01:13:30.273
[nagsisigawan ang mga kalahok]

1571
01:13:31.207 --> 01:13:33.409
- [bulalas]
- Whoa, ang galing nila.

1572
01:13:33.476 --> 01:13:35.878
Gumagawa siya ng maraming uppercut!

1573
01:13:35.945 --> 01:13:37.313
Gawa ba sa bakal ang abs na iyon?

1574
01:13:37.380 --> 01:13:38.547
Tapos na siya.

1575
01:13:38.614 --> 01:13:40.249
Napaka-feisty talaga ni Park Youngho.

1576
01:13:40.316 --> 01:13:42.418
{\an8}[Lee]
Panalo si Park Youngho mula sa red corner.

1577
01:13:42.885 --> 01:13:44.487
Lumipat tayo sa Ring No. 7.

1578
01:13:45.588 --> 01:13:46.589
[bulalas ng kalahok]

1579
