- Takbo!

1685
01:18:37.179 --> 01:18:38.380
Huling isa! Halika na!

1686
01:18:38.447 --> 01:18:39.515
- Push through!
- [sumisigaw]

1687
01:18:39.582 --> 01:18:41.150
Maaari tayong manalo sa bagay na ito!

1688
01:19:02.404 --> 01:19:04.406
Isinalin ni Jisu Park

